  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ヒゲが　アンテナの　やくわり。\nでんぱを　そうじゅしんして　とおくの\nなかまと　れんらくを　とりあうのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "수염이 안테나의 역할을 한다.\n전파를 송수신해서 멀리 떨어진\n동료와 서로 연락하는 것이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses moustaches lui servent d’antennes, et lui\npermettent d’envoyer et de recevoir des signaux\npour communiquer à distance avec ses congénères.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Seine Schnurrhaare dienen ihm als Antennen. Durch\ndas Senden und Empfangen von elektrischen Wellen\nkann es mit weit entfernten Freunden kommunizieren.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus bigotes hacen la función de antenas, por lo\nque puede enviar y recibir ondas eléctricas para\ncomunicarse a grandes distancias.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "I suoi baffi fungono da antenne che trasmettono e\nricevono onde radio. Se ne serve per comunicare\ncon i suoi simili.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its whiskers serve as antennas. By sending and\nreceiving electrical waves, it can communicate\nwith others over vast distances.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ヒゲが　アンテナの　役割。\n電波を　送受信して　遠くの　仲間と\n連絡を　取り合うのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus bigotes hacen la función de antenas, por lo\nque puede enviar y recibir ondas eléctricas para\ncomunicarse a grandes distancias.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "しっぽで　はつでんしょや　みんかの\nコンセントから　でんきを　すいとり\nヒゲから　でんげきを　うちだす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "꼬리로 발전소나 민가의\n콘센트에서 전기를 흡수하여\n수염에서 전격을 날린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il utilise sa queue pour pomper l’énergie des centrales\nélectriques ou pour se brancher sur les prises des\nmaisons. Ses moustaches envoient des décharges.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit seinem Schwanz zapft es Kraftwerke sowie\nSteckdosen in Häusern an, um Strom zu tanken,\nden es über seine Schnurrhaare wieder entlädt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Con su cola absorbe la electricidad procedente de las\ncentrales de energía o los enchufes de las casas,\npara liberarla en forma de ataque por los bigotes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Con la coda può assorbire energia dalle prese di\ncorrente di centrali elettriche e abitazioni per poi\nscaricarla dai baffi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It uses its tail to absorb electricity from\npower plants or from outlets in houses,\nand then it fires the electricity from its whiskers.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "尻尾で　発電所や　民家の\nコンセントから　電気を　吸い取り\nヒゲから　電撃を　撃ち出す。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
