      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "みんかに　しのびこみ　コンセントから\nでんきを　ぬすむ。　でんきだいが\nおかしいときは　こいつの　しわざ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "민가에 숨어들어 콘센트에서\n전기를 훔친다. 전기료가\n이상할 때는 이 녀석의 소행이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會潛入人們家裡，從插座偷電。\n如果發現電費不正常，\n那就是這傢伙幹的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il s’introduit chez les gens pour voler l’électricité\nvia les prises de courant. On sait qui blâmer\nen cas de facture d’électricité trop élevée !",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es schleicht sich in Häuser und zapft an den\nSteckdosen Strom ab. Fällt die Stromrechnung\nmal unerwartet hoch aus, ist Dedenne schuld.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se infiltra en los hogares para robar energía de\nlos enchufes. Si la factura de la electricidad es\ninusualmente alta, seguro que él tiene la culpa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si intrufola nelle case per rubare energia dalle\nprese elettriche. Se la bolletta della luce è\nstranamente alta, c’è di sicuro il suo zampino!",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It sneaks into people’s homes and steals\nelectricity from their outlets. When your electric\nbill seems off, it’s the handiwork of this rascal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "民家に　忍びこみ　コンセントから\n電気を　盗む。　電気代が\nおかしいときは　こいつの　仕業。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "潜入民居，从插座里偷电。\n电费很奇怪的时候，\n就是这家伙的杰作。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
